        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2011",
        "question_text": "<p>Choose the correct tense of the verb to complete the sentence:<br><i>By the time we arrived, the meeting <u>______</u>.</i></p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The sentence requires the <b>past perfect tense</b> (<i>had ended</i>) because the action was completed before another past action (<i>arrived</i>). The past perfect tense is formed with <i>had + past participle</i>.</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
        "comments_count": 0,
        "options": [
