        "topic": "Subject-Verb Agreement",
        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2011",
        "question_text": "<p>Select the correct verb to agree with the subject:<br><i>Neither the teacher nor the students <u>______</u> happy with the results.</i></p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>When subjects are joined by <i>neither...nor</i>, the verb agrees with the <b>closer subject</b>. Here, <i>students</i> (plural) is closer, so the verb must be plural (<i>were</i>).</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
