        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2011",
        "question_text": "<p>Change the following direct speech to indirect speech:<br><i>\"I will travel tomorrow,\" she said.</i></p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>In indirect speech, the tense shifts back (future <i>will</i> \u2192 conditional <i>would</i>), and pronouns adjust (<i>I</i> \u2192 <i>she</i>). The reporting verb <i>said</i> remains in the past tense.</p>",
